1	9	Functional dyspepsia, often referred to as "indigestion," is a vague and variable problem that is functional in nature but usually not caused by underlying structural issues.	1	2026-04-06 21:33:58.34407+00	general
2	9	Specific remedies are often bitter carminatives or nervine carminatives.	2	2026-04-06 21:33:58.34407+00	general
3	9	Often, the traditional simple (tea made from a single fresh remedy) is the best treatment.	3	2026-04-06 21:33:58.34407+00	general
